          %h2#properties Properties
          %p
            The
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Eilenberg-Moore+category"} Eilenberg-Moore category
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coalgebras"} coalgebras
            over the jet comonad has the interpretation of the category of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/partial+differential+equations"} partial differential equations
            with
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/variables"} variables
            in
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi X
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/co-Kleisli+category"} co-Kleisli category
            of the jet comonad has the interpretation as being the category of bundles over
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi X
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} X
            with
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential+operators"} differential operators
            between them as morphisms (
            %a{:href => "#Marvan86"}> Marvan 86
            ,
            = succeed ")." do
              %a{:href => "#Marvan89"} Marvan 89
          %h2#related_concepts Related concepts
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topos+of+coalgebras+over+a+comonad"} topos of coalgebras over a comonad
            %li
              %p
                in
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Borger%27s+absolute+geometry"} Borger's absolute geometry
                a similar base change as above is interpreted as the
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/arithmetic+jet+space"} arithmetic jet space
                construction.
          %h2#References References
          %p
            In the context of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential+geometry"} differential geometry
            the comonad structure on the jet bundle construction, as well as the interpretation of its EM-category as that of partial differential equations, is due to
          %ul
            %li#Marvan86
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michal+Marvan"}> Michal Marvan
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em A note on the category of partial differential equations
              = succeed "," do
                %em Differential geometry and its applications
              = succeed ")" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/MarvanJetComonadPDE.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
          %blockquote
            %p
              (Proposition 1.4 in
              %a{:href => "#Marvan86"} Marvan 86
              needs an extra “weakened transversality” condition on the equalizer, this is fixed in (Theorem 1.3,
              = succeed ")." do
                %a{:href => "#MarvanThesis"} Marvan’s thesis
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi V
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} V
              functor, which maps fibered manifolds to their vertical tangent bundles.)
          %ul
            %li#MarvanThesis
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michal+Marvan"}> Michal Marvan
                , thesis, 1989 (
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/MarvanThesis.pdf", :title => "pdf"}> pdf
                ,
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://www.slu.cz/math/cz/lide/marvan-michal/docs/mar89-ocr.pdf"} web
            %li#Marvan89
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michal+Marvan"}> Michal Marvan
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em On the horizontal cohomology with general coefficients
                = succeed "," do
                  %a{:href => "http://old.math.slu.cz/People/MichalMarvan/Annotations/horizontal.php"} web announcement
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://dml.cz/dmlcz/701469"} web archive
            %li#Marvan93
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Michal+Marvan"}> Michal Marvan
                , section 1.1 of
                = succeed "," do
                  %em On Zero-Curvature Representations of Partial Differential Equations
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://citeseerx.ist.psu.edu/viewdoc/summary?doi=10.1.1.45.5631"} web
          %p
            Discussion in
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/synthetic+differential+geometry"} synthetic differential geometry
          %ul
            %li#Deligne70
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Pierre+Deligne"}> Pierre Deligne
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Equations Différentielles à Points Singuliers Réguliers
            %li#Kock10
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Anders+Kock"}> Anders Kock
                , remark 7.3.1
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Synthetic geometry of manifolds
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "http://home.imf.au.dk/kock/SGM-final.pdf"} pdf
          %p
            In the context of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/algebraic+geometry"} algebraic geometry
            and
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D-geometry"} D-geometry
            the comonad structure is observed in:
          %ul
            %li#Lurie
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jacob+Lurie"}> Jacob Lurie
              ,
              %em
                Notes on crystals and algebraic
                = succeed "-modules" do
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                    %semantics
                      %mrow
                        %mi 𝒟
                      %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{D}
              (2010) &amp;lbrack;
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Lurie-NotesOnCrystals.pdf", :title => "pdf"}> pdf
              \&amp;rbrack;
          %p
            Discussion in
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential+cohesion"} differential cohesion
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Igor+Khavkine"}> Igor Khavkine
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Urs+Schreiber"} Urs Schreiber
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/Synthetic+variational+calculus"} Synthetic geometry of differential equations: I. Jets and comonad structure
              (
              %a{:href => "https://arxiv.org/abs/1701.06238"}> arXiv:1701.06238
              )
          %p
            Discussion in differentially cohesive
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/modal+homotopy+type+theory"} modal
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/homotopy+type+theory"} homotopy type theory
          %ul
            %li#Wellen17
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Felix+Wellen"}> Felix Wellen
                ,
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/thesis+Wellen"} Formalizing Cartan Geometry in Modal Homotopy Type Theory
                (2017)
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Felix+Cherubini"}> Felix Cherubini
                \:
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
